# public key (to secure APIs etc)
Server init.

# generate keys
>> keys := Isanduku-yumutekano kora-imfunguzo.

# private (secret) key
>> sk := keys icya-mbere.

# public key
>> pk := keys icya-nyuma.

# sign a message
>> sig := Isanduku-yumutekano sinya: ['abc'] na: sk.

Ibisohoka andika: sig uburebure, umurongo-mushya.